Z||000002||RossT||10-28-2001||11:39 AM||||I too was getting a code 35 on my new formula.  I searched the forum from day one and found that most 35's were not the fault of the IAC, but rather a vacuum leak.  Someone suggested to use a small dental mirror to check around the egr tube.  Sure enough on the back side of the intake side of the tube was a very small hairline crack.<BR>Thus I ordered a new tube from IRM&gt;||||reg||1
